>        Value type: <string>
> -      Definition: Must include "fsl,sec-v4.0-mon".
> +      Definition: Must include "fsl,sec-v4.0-mon" and "syscon".
>  
>    - reg
>        Usage: required
> @@ -324,7 +325,7 @@ Secure Non-Volatile Storage (SNVS) Node
